  "summary_en": "ANSI blog post explaining the 2025 revision of the US industrial robot safety standard ANSI/A3 R15.06 (Parts 1–3). The revision harmonizes with ISO 10218-1/-2:2025 and replaces R15.06-2012. It makes functional safety requirements explicit, reframes collaborative applications, adds cybersecurity considerations and refines terminology for manufacturers and integrators.",
